                                "sense_id": "4de9c5db-2ca4-36e5-bf23-fd46ab39ebf0",
                                "text": "Out of my lean and low ability\nI’ll lend you something: my having is not much;\nI’ll make division of my present with you:\nHold, there’s half my coffer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32147d9c-ea14-4998-9c6e-a09c469ef5d9",
                                "sense_id": "4de9c5db-2ca4-36e5-bf23-fd46ab39ebf0",
                                "text": "Your havings wasted by the scythe and spade—\nYour rights and charters hobnail’d into slush—"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
